{
    "title": "CarParts.com",
    "description": "Download the CarParts.com app and accelerate convenience with access to over 850,000 auto parts at your fingertips, making it easier than ever before to find the parts you need\u2014anytime, anywhere. Plus, enjoy savings of up to 50% off when compared to your local dealership or auto parts store (and save yourself multiple trips in the process!).\r\nUnleash the full potential of the CarParts.com experience with some of our favourite benefits:\r\n\r\nFitment Guaranteed\r\nSay goodbye to guesswork! Our intuitive vehicle selector ensures the perfect fit for your ride. Just enter your year, make, and model and look for the green \"Guaranteed to Fit\" checkmark, ensuring the part you buy flawlessly fits your vehicle every time.\r\n\r\nFast Shipping\r\nWe've strategically placed distribution centers nationwide, so you can get parts delivered to your doorstep at turbocharged speed.\r\n\r\nMy Account\r\nNo need to dig through your inbox or type in your info every time! Create an account to track orders and enjoy faster checkouts with saved addresses, payment methods, and vehicles.\r\n\r\nMy Garage\r\nWhether it's your daily driver or a fleet of cars, save all your vehicles' info in \"My Garage\" for effortless shopping and a tailor-made experience that's just for you.\r\n\r\nHassle-Free Returns\r\nNo detours or pit stops! Enjoy a simple, seamless self-service returns experience.\r\n\r\nBuy Now, Pay Later\r\nUrgent repairs but tight on cash? We offer flexible payment options so you can take care of it now and pay your way.\r\n\r\nHow-To Guides\r\nWe're more than just a parts provider; we're your automotive support crew. Our auto repair and care guides empower you to conquer any DIY job with ease.",
